        "author": "Joe M.",
        "date": "2025-08-08T17:41:25Z",
        "id": "689644de253d905539b86fa7",
        "label": "Okay",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 6,
        "text": "The location is beautiful, but for the premium price, we were a little disappointed and expected more. Basic amenities like toilet paper, paper towels, trash bags, dishwasher soap, salt & pepper, and a tea kettle should be included, more than just a couple days worth, maybe? We’re paying over five figures, and you can’t afford to leave us a few extra toilet paper rolls? You can only give us two trash bags? We have to go to the store to buy more dish soap?The quality of the appliances, the particle board furniture, the cheap Walmart plastic blender, and light fixtures from Home Depot - were a little disappointing. Additionally, we had several communication problems, such as needing to ask management for the WiFi password, the gate code to the beach, and the location of the large outside trash cans. The instructions provided on paper, email, and the online portal were all conflicting.Despite these issues, we had a pleasant overall experience. The views were beautiful. However, we wouldn’t recommend staying there again unless they address the problems mentioned above.",
